{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ZEC","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"撒迦利亞書","commonName":"撒迦利亞書","title":"撒迦利亞書","order":38,"numberOfChapters":14,"sha256":"596e12e88f20bda085f475cd8057e433ebcfbd7db4b18a72e7597b0902128ee5","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ZEC/1.json","lastChapterNumber":14,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ZEC/14.json","totalNumberOfVerses":211},"chapter":{"number":6,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["馬車的異象"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["我又舉目觀看，見有四輛車從兩山中間出來；那山是銅山。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["第一輛車套着紅馬，第二輛車套着黑馬。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["第三輛車套着白馬，第四輛車套着有斑點的壯馬。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["我就問與我說話的天使說：「主啊，這是甚麼意思？」"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["天使回答我說：「這是天的四風，是從普天下的主面前出來的。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["套着黑馬的車往北方去，白馬跟隨在後；有斑點的馬往南方去。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["壯馬出來，要在遍地走來走去。天使說：「你們只管在遍地走來走去。」牠們就照樣行了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["他又呼叫我說：「看哪，往北方去的已在北方安慰我的心。」"]},{"type":"heading","content":["為約書亞加冕"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["耶和華的話臨到我說："]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["「你要從被擄之人中取黑玳、多比雅、耶大雅的金銀。這三人是從巴比倫來到西番雅的兒子約西亞的家裏。當日你要進他的家，"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["取這金銀做冠冕，戴在約撒答的兒子大祭司約書亞的頭上，"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["對他說，萬軍之耶和華如此說：看哪，那名稱為大衛苗裔的，他要在本處長起來，並要建造耶和華的殿。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["他要建造耶和華的殿，並擔負尊榮，坐在位上掌王權；又必在位上作祭司，使兩職之間籌定和平。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["這冠冕要歸希連",{"noteId":6},"、多比雅、耶大雅，和西番雅的兒子賢",{"noteId":7},"，放在耶和華的殿裏為記念。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["遠方的人也要來建造耶和華的殿，你們就知道萬軍之耶和華差遣我到你們這裏來。你們若留意聽從耶和華－你們上帝的話，這事必然成就。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":6,"caller":"-","text":"就是黑玳","reference":{"chapter":6,"verse":14}},{"noteId":7,"caller":"-","text":"就是約西亞","reference":{"chapter":6,"verse":14}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ZEC/6.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ZEC/7.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ZEC/5.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":15}